caddy-tui (1.7.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New: --export / [o] writes the configuration (Caddyfile, compose, .env and,
    optionally, certificates and alerts settings) to a checksummed tar.gz, and
    --import restores it into a new Caddy in Docker on another server,
    validating first and putting the same certificates back.

